# **Interface Agreement: Claim Investigation and Integration**

**Interface name:** Claim Investigation and Integration Interface  
**Owners:** Boyu Liu (Kilo524), Claim Investigation; Meshaal Aldawood (meshaalaldawood), Integration  
**Status:** Draft  
**Version and date approved:** Not yet approved

## **1\. Purpose and Scope**

This interface enables the Claim Investigation subsystem to provide investigation results to the Integration subsystem so that the results can be incorporated into the final maintainer-facing system output.

This agreement covers the information passed from Claim Investigation to Integration, including the structure, required characteristics, and handling of investigation results.

This agreement does not define:

• How Claim Investigation performs its internal investigation.  
• How Integration combines subsystem outputs into the final report.  
• How Input Evaluation identifies or evaluates claims before they reach Claim Investigation.

